{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "> | AD-01 · 仅正式命令 | 向审计员输入的语义正文只能是单行 `/audit workspace-NNN goal-NNN`（工作区编号、目标编号）或 `/v", "sequence": 1}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "a192049e-60c9-4b25-8e92-805c0d3a975e", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.216Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\nision-audit vp-NNN`（VP 编号）。前缀 `workspace-` / `goal-` / `vp-` 必须小写且拼写固定，与命令名同级；编号为 1～3 位 AS\r\nCII 十进制正整数（1～999），自动输出补零为三位（001～999），入口可接收 1～3 位并补零。拒绝裸数字、大小写或拼写不符的前\r\n", "sequence": 2}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "f305f3b0-e30e-4dfa-89bd-ce10454e6450", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.216Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "缀、完整 id/slug 冒充选择器、选择器顺序错误、0、非数字、负数、小数、科学计数、超三位、未替换占位、多余参数、换行、注释", "sequence": 3}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "80785ecd-61e6-48e2-a496-ec8d34d608a8", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.216Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 4}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "029849b7-442b-4bf5-a911-f2c059a85909", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.216Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "或包装；不得截掉附言后偷偷发送。 |\r\n", "sequence": 5}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "3ea3a29e-99b8-4ff7-890c-b2045573e8a8", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.217Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  | AD-02 · 唯一绑定 | 带标签编号只是入口选择器，按 workspace-protocol §2.7 恢复完整 workspace_id + goal_id 或 VP id。", "sequence": 6}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "0cc31ef7-5a58-426c-8c7e-4cf2eca6429e", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.217Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n零匹配、多匹配、元信息不符、旧/混合布局或仓外逃逸均停止，不任选、不把其他区目标正文读入当前上下文。 |\r\n  | AD-03 · 不限制视角 | 禁止编排器自行编写审计提示词，或追加阶段、scope、文件清单、finding 提示、结论预期。“补充背景”\r\n", "sequence": 7}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "7e19d692-4b3c-4e4c-8217-6eff6596ae56", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.217Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "也不能绕过。审计员自行通读目标台账/VP 与适用权威，判断审计范围并提出相关问题；正式意见的 scope 由审计员形成。 |", "sequence": 8}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "025e91f0-ad1d-4da3-a95b-beedd316bb63", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.217Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 9}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "3bcd56c1-d7cb-4ae8-96c2-d1c89c0fb872", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.217Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  | AD-04 · 干净上下文 | 使用独立干净会话，不复制编排历史；description、system、context、附件、stdin 等不得夹带编排器自", "sequence": 10}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "c0ca8648-3ba5-4a49-a18b-43afaa9ec95d", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.217Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 11}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "214ec05c-735d-4648-bef7-90a908aa05b2", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.217Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "编审计指令。仓库 cwd、模型与 provider 可作调用配置；已安装的正式审计 skill/prompt 是入口自身方法论，不是本次编排器生成\r\n", "sequence": 12}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "68093916-42fe-45e1-aee3-eea8f62d9637", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.217Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "的提示。 |", "sequence": 13}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "d6961401-49ae-4070-ab9a-a75f2230ecd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 14}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "9b18e1fc-c7e5-49eb-aae3-6f64784e7a7d", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  | AD-05 · 失败不替代 | provider 不能识别或加载正式入口、失败、超时或无可核对输出时，门禁保持未满足；不自编提示补齐、", "sequence": 15}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "8ac02992-bc69-4bd1-8e37-1ba609c8d2ab", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 16}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "8c6838fa-0fe5-4ef9-a521-8d55b1e2e4a0", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "不冒充 independent、不自动换 provider。等待用户信息按 P-004 的 UI 契约处理。 |", "sequence": 17}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "43aac458-c11d-4ce5-8c81-11d179b6718b", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 18}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "807a3d7b-f6a3-40c4-bb73-248e76bf4a0b", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  | AD-06 · 通道与保证 | MCP 的 task 若承载自动派发，正文同样只能为合法命令；goal_id 等身份元数据须一致，scope/guidance\r\n", "sequence": 19}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "a8cd4a16-720c-45f1-b6cb-d94610911b08", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": " 不得注入限制。保留人类直调的既有参数兼容，不据此推定自动请求获豁免。File/Skills 的规范约束不等于系统级强制拦截；静态测\r\n", "sequence": 20}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "2d12e92e-ad18-4397-86a6-76c524fb9012", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "试、入口探针与真实问答证据须分别陈述。 |\r\n", "sequence": 21}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "94024e13-5ffd-45f5-8c5b-b11d9b62b6a7", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.218Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  \r\n", "sequence": 22}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "929ae37e-49b5-4576-ae5d-03cc63d3342b", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.219Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  示例：自动 `/audit workspace-002 goal-013` 合法；`/audit 002 013`、`/audit workspace-002 goal-013 仅审S2`、另加“请只\r\n", "sequence": 23}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "b165afe0-d398-4321-8884-24306ad3439d", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.219Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "看这些文件”的上下文均不合法。复审仍只输入正式命令，由审计员从台账自行发现修正和未闭合项。\r\n", "sequence": 24}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "c501ca5d-d91b-47c3-b33b-800c955d31e9", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.219Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  \r\n  <a id=\"audit-session-lifecycle\"></a>\r\n", "sequence": 25}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "263e0cee-b8b4-4f26-acfe-d1558bd3ce03", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.219Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  \r\n", "sequence": 26}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "751832de-91b4-4f71-994f-4a3da53db78a", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.219Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  #### 正式独立审计与普通探索子代理的适用边界\r\n", "sequence": 27}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "db2f8869-e45b-4d2b-9db5-97f88b06a9b4", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.219Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  ", "sequence": 28}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "212ddd68-30e9-4484-8075-2d875ac8da7c", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.219Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 29}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "93c94b65-c234-4eb1-8a91-40327b7e57cf", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.219Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "> | UI-01 · 同步优先 | 当前宿主有可用且允许用于该问题的阻塞询问卡片时必须使用。选择题提供 2～3 个互斥可执行选项、AI 推", "sequence": 30}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "a84df6f3-8317-437f-98fd-d75fd3cf4624", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.220Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n荐及主要取舍，保留自由输入；客户端自带自由输入时不再重复添加“其他”。卡片不可用、用途受限或 headless 无真人答复通路时，\r\n", "sequence": 31}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "83a30a3f-2106-4260-9860-5477e48017cd", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.220Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "文本提问并同样停止等待。异步询问不替代同步阻塞。 |\r\n", "sequence": 32}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "db0153ed-5278-4bf7-a588-4f8cd37c323c", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.220Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  | UI-02 · 真实答复 | 按问题编号和原题逐项核对真实提交内容。空对象、空列表、null、空白串、缺问题、答非所问、取消、关闭\r\n", "sequence": 33}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "aa195211-b54a-4a97-aff5-a90f4ee51158", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.220Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "、超时、仅展示成功、默认预选未提交均为未答复。工具 exit 0、SDK allow、权限批准或代理声称“用户同意”均不是信息答复证据；\r\n", "sequence": 34}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "907538e6-e5ca-4d67-9ae6-54280336711e", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "不得补默认选择或虚构答复。部分答复仅解决已明确回答的部分。 |\r\n", "sequence": 35}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "5ccf2e56-08f1-4360-9435-e6f9c31475af", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  | UI-03 · 组合等待 | 同步卡片必须实际调用并等待返回，把原问题/选项和未答状态保留在宿主会话中，不能展示卡片后结束等待\r\n", "sequence": 36}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "ee57a463-d289-4ebd-8fe6-e3ac0ac209b7", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "、另起执行轮或轮询重问。已有原生 `/goal` 且卡片不能持续挂起时，组合使用宿主公开的目标停止/等待能力；先读实际工具契约，", "sequence": 37}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "3a602d01-ca09-4bd4-9bef-d6a8ed091695", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n仅在其允许条件成立时控制该原生目标并核对返回。不得把治理 Goal 置 blocked 来代替。 |\r\n", "sequence": 38}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "40f2ee0b-a418-446f-993b-6e14a0e045be", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  | UI-04 · 宿主边界 | 无原生目标仍等待当前任务，不新建目标。不可用/用途受限/headless 无答复通路时，文本提问并停止；已\r\n", "sequence": 39}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "8090fd8d-a7b2-4b09-98bc-4c03c0d56ae9", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "有自动续跑应使用合法的原生停止机制。若机制不存在或受权限/工具前置条件限制，明确报告停止能力未确认，并提示用户原生暂停/\r\n", "sequence": 40}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "0203854f-f0be-441e-a2c6-0a10d093e1d3", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "中断方式，不虚构 blocked/paused 成功，不绕过工具契约。独立审计同样等待，不越权改治理 meta。 |\r\n", "sequence": 41}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "1c0d8fab-f61e-42c6-b04b-2136754ef764", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  | UI-05 · 缺答即停 | 卡片空返回、取消或其他未答状态后停止执行，不实施/推进/放行/关门或继续其他任务，不自动重试代答。\r\n", "sequence": 42}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "4777e1ea-3ac7-44c0-8d7c-4e9503c2592f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.221Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "宿主自动续跑仍先检查会话中的待答，未收到真实答复就继续合法等待/停止，不以“上一轮结束”当作目标已停。不得为每轮重复追加待\r\n", "sequence": 43}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "99281f68-0fd8-48a8-b8f3-23f26e287d2a", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "答流水或重写治理状态；沉默不是 residual/overruled。 |\r\n  | UI-06 · 有据恢复 | 收到真实答复后逐题核对原问题、来源与范围，实际决策按正常治理规则留痕；复核其余信息/审计门禁和其\r\n", "sequence": 44}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "791782c4-1812-480d-b0e2-43f0ede2b253", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "他阻塞，只继续已获答复的范围。原生目标恢复须满足宿主契约与用户授权；不得因答复自动改治理 Goal 为 active/done、解除其他\r\n", "sequence": 45}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "37e9660e-a969-4f00-8456-8495a18a47f7", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "交付阻塞或恢复用户主动暂停的目标。重启/续跑同样先检查待答。 |", "sequence": 46}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "412719da-c82e-4291-9d14-0c17ede454a7", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n  \r\n", "sequence": 47}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "de7ffaf3-128a-4305-bad5-fc01f3cb99e4", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  **最小留痕**：卡片/聊天中的原题、实际返回与未答状态足以支持本次等待，**无需另次确认**，也无需额外治理写盘。只有用户要\r\n", "sequence": 48}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "6fdf7ef3-c4f1-4581-b021-56d673e38ad7", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "求跨会话交接，或待答本身属于必需的信息/决策证据时，才在已有适当位置保留一次最小记录；不得强制修改 Goal 状态、同步目标树\r\n", "sequence": 49}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "f4515ffb-1a2d-4dd6-ba95-e122f1ad3496", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "或为自动续跑重复写盘。实际决策、信息项变化与真实交付阻塞仍按原治理规则记载；写盘失败不构成用户答复或继续执行的理由。", "sequence": 50}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "736cc709-2e4b-4854-b0af-b45304582b26", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n  \r\n", "sequence": 51}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "f9b811b0-7cde-435f-843c-8119a37b3a70", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.222Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "  具体能力依宿主与模式选择：Codex 的 `request_user_input` 应同步等待；`get_goal`/`update_goal` 仅在实际可用时用于已有原", "sequence": 52}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "e4680484-6b26-4a2e-9112-cf42348198ac", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.223Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n生目标，严格遵守 blocked 连续阻塞阈值、paused 用户明确请求等前置条件，不为满足本规则提前绕过。用户可用 `/goal pause` 控\r\n", "sequence": 53}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "c0222984-1166-431a-bf20-96e6000f1941", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.223Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "制 Codex / Grok Build 已有目标；未证实 Claude Code 提供同名原生命令时不得照搬，可使用实际提供的阻塞询问/中断能力。无原", "sequence": 54}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "e4dd6d50-bb62-4fc9-a2c9-857a01fb5037", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.223Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n生停止接口时不得宣称系统级已拦截。静态规范、单轮 headless 退出或模拟空结果不能证明原生 `/goal` 取消/恢复，运行时主张须\r\n", "sequence": 55}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "87184657-5482-4aa9-995a-2e90064482de", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.223Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "有对应版本、模式、工具返回与续跑观察证据。\r\n  \r\n  ### 4.1 审计模式或 provider 无法唯一确定\r\n", "sequence": 56}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "fb1fe1b7-2aef-4931-8389-7c5e0cb40c68", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.223Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
