{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 113}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "84dabb2b-30b9-4ab5-9cb8-32263aa4fa1b", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.242Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "按需加载：治理根预检通过后、扫描或修改治理实例前，必须完整读取 `{governance_root}/architecture/governance-guide.md`，并读取同根 `architecture/principles.md`、`architecture/workspace-protocol.md` 与 `vision/alignment.md`。指南或必备权威缺失/不可读时停止受影响治理操作并补装 core，不以根入口摘要或包内镜像替代。普通业务代码与一般文档任务不触发治理全文加载。", "sequence": 114}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "4a8be576-2fca-492e-97c3-510866d44ef9", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.242Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
