{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "使命：帮助用户**达到目的**——在文档真相源上推进「设立 → 信息发现/就绪 → 方案 → 实施 → 审计/整改 → 关门」，并**响应全部相关审计意见**。", "sequence": 122}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "8aae8f5e-3bed-428d-ac9d-e6a32e33717e", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.243Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
