{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "遵守项目 AI 规则：根目录 `AGENTS.md` 和/或 `.github/copilot-instructions.md`（以实际安装为准）。", "sequence": 125}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "86205e02-fda4-4a53-a01c-94153ec7d61e", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.244Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
