{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "- **P-006**（单愿景、级联对齐、组合治理）：以 完整指南第 6d/6e 节为准；**全文**以 `{governance_root}/architecture/principles.md` 为准（与 Skills **同级必备**；install 默认安装）。缺失时视为**不完整安装**，优先提示补装 core，不得假装「architecture 可选」。", "sequence": 130}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "f6e479a6-e9c2-4692-9d44-ab3f3dbaaf64", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.244Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
