{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "# 工作方式（优先遵守）", "sequence": 135}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "cbf8bcad-1fc0-474f-889f-04885592ac1a", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.245Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 136}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "24cde797-57cb-4126-b0bb-f72190528e3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.245Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 137}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "253ee410-cb08-444c-a643-23692adf202c", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.245Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "1. **一条主路径**：用户说「帮我推进」「治理」「下一步」或调用 `/govern` 时，直接走本流程（**实现层**）。按情境选用 create / decision / execution / audit，用户无需先选「填哪张表」。", "sequence": 138}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "74975594-bc54-411f-b2d8-0a9c721d3443", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.245Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 139}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "9d4cd17b-0edf-4bfa-9568-bcbe9ed0dad2", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.245Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "2. **文档驱动**：以当前工作区根的 `goal-tree.md` 与目标五件套为真相源；**先判定**现行 `{governance_root}/vision/charter.md`（完整安装必有；缺则仅引导补齐 Charter→VP）；再读 alignment；定位 `{governance_root}/workspaces/workspace-<NNN>-<slug>/workspace.md` 并校验 Root Goal、canonical 范围与**必填** `plan_refs`/`prim", "sequence": 140}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "e37dea67-473a-4b62-8c01-d7b995109721", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.245Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "ary_plan`（角色仅 `primary` / `delivery`，无 opt-out）；进度与结论只写已发生的事实；不确定标「待确认」。`progress`（若有）只能由显式检查点确定性派生，不能放行阶段、关闭 finding 或覆盖 status；`{governance_root}/vision/` 不是 progress 权威。\r\n", "sequence": 141}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "cc7e286f-6331-4db9-9b3d-786aaf5bc490", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.246Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "3. **扫描 → 意见台账 → 分类 → 提议 → 确认 → 写入**：写入前先建议并确认（用户本轮已明确写入指令时可直接执行）。等待答复时遵守 UI 契约控制宿主执行，不为等待自动修改治理状态或增加同步写盘。", "sequence": 142}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "a55c387b-5633-414f-bc6b-051860cd4701", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.246Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 143}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "a60a4abe-3649-4656-bf16-80dc928da6a4", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.246Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "4. **大目标先纲领路线图（P-001）**：范围大或步骤不明时，先在 meta/decision 写高层阶段与先后关系，再按阶段立项；本回合聚焦一个清晰下一步。", "sequence": 144}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "6e70f67a-d70f-4878-af32-0baec4b99f68", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.246Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 145}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "6f2ccd27-9c80-4b30-a346-f35ed9ac9f56", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.246Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "5. **信息就绪（P-005）**：不假定设立时已知一切。识别信息项、影响门禁与最晚需要阶段；允许先推进澄清/收集，但不把开放 required 信息项写成已知或默许越过受影响门禁。", "sequence": 146}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "0ea800b0-b1ce-44f8-9f0a-65c47074db83", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.246Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 147}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "edf43085-6845-4652-a9e9-79d397dcf0b4", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.246Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "6. **阶段质量意识（P-002）**：不只填表；关注目标是否可验证、是否有方案/计划、实施是否有证据、是否具备关门条件。小目标可合并审视步骤。", "sequence": 148}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "0b930b6c-a1bd-4129-8a08-afba80ac826f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.247Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 149}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "24029634-ef8b-4f25-b0f1-bd30cfe36749", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.247Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "7. **语言与 slug**：标题与正文使用用户正在使用的语言；文件夹 slug 用小写英文短横线。", "sequence": 150}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "8b3ea4d4-62f6-4ba1-8717-483ddfb500c5", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.247Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 151}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "541f7e60-0627-46b0-b2d2-9fd696af8cee", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.247Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
