{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "# 目标漂移检查（GD-01～GD-08）", "sequence": 180}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "57c15562-726e-4abc-af36-6594fab68e16", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.250Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 181}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "db8e718a-7080-4c9e-85ec-e1d167a767e8", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.250Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 182}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "ba67408c-5358-45c4-b232-80f74b478be9", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.250Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "执行 `{governance_root}/architecture/principles.md#goal-drift`。当前目标有合法 parent、当前清单/测试全绿不等于对齐。立项、方案冻结、阶段切换、范围变化和关门前，读取直接父目标相关目的/成功标准/非目标/路线图与决策（Root 对 VP），比较「父级结果→原始立项与有效授权变更→当前范围/路线图→实际产物」。记录具体贡献、证据与剩余承诺；审计 A 条目必须保留对照结论，不能只列本地成功标准。", "sequence": 183}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "d5c6f81c-1e3e-44e4-acec-9f38a6cee1b3", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.250Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 184}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "a3c31c62-2b2d-44cd-9479-eefdae02ea2a", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.250Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 185}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "31bef671-03e0-40d9-bf2f-2330b189e1a8", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "新建目标首条 decision 保留原始用户授权、范围/成功标准、父级条目及版本引用；路线图逐项覆盖承诺结果，未覆盖项保持未完成/待规划，过程里程碑不替代结果。实质改承诺或削弱/替代验收前，留原值→新值、父级影响与批准来源，先获对应范围用户明确裁决；已有授权内实现细化不重复询问。未经批准不改 meta 追认。", "sequence": 186}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "3447e9ef-c39b-43a4-8b57-dfc04a25a8d7", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 187}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "2b2e79d7-1172-46fe-b022-28d79ef13cfc", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 188}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "a3aaa30d-96a9-41b6-b4ac-798c6dc94f45", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "发现显著漂移或关键授权/贡献证据不足，暂停受影响范围，登记 required finding/信息项并回流修正，P-003 闭合前不放行；冲突/授权不明按 P-004 等待，不把沉默当批准。合法阶段子集、信息收集和已批准调整不自动算漂移，须明确贡献并保留父级剩余承诺。既有目标按可用历史重建，不伪造基线；按需沿同区父链追溯，不扫描无关子树/他区。独立审计只写本目标意见；规范为 L0。", "sequence": 189}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "4c8c90ab-9f7c-4c29-84fc-931c883e06fe", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 190}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "9770cbdf-8f24-4a3f-ba07-b9bb79f3829f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 191}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "c4d97448-338e-4e63-bfa0-2d7f438deca2", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "# P-005 信息就绪（目标领域）", "sequence": 192}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "d4a3b9f2-1a79-4c3b-b5e1-9ee357d1a3bb", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 193}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "7e75b773-ec0a-4919-802b-271adc0a260f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 194}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "37fadbab-5744-412a-9b5b-4667671c8d10", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.251Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "上表只处理仓库布局等元信息，**不能**代替目标本身的信息发现。对焦点目标：", "sequence": 195}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "47c6cf9c-d329-4f0f-a480-7b0afabe04e0", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 196}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "4f2ee029-6b17-470c-a3f3-bada5432d113", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 197}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "f21f4545-a6f4-4f58-a0f1-589d6d6cdba5", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "1. 找到 `00-meta.md` 或 `01-decision.md` 中的信息需求表；没有表时，不假定“没有未知”，而是判断本轮是否需要建立。", "sequence": 198}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "c372709e-0ae8-4cc8-a72d-6315f9c061f9", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 199}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "18722a45-d7e7-4c63-b798-631ad5575484", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "2. 对每个相关 `I-00N` 判断：它是 `required` 还是 `non-blocking`、影响什么门禁、最晚何时需要、状态是否有证据，是否只是低风险可逆项。", "sequence": 200}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "98082411-8cff-4f0a-8ae7-70ab70938ad9", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 201}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "e18bfad2-c43c-4f8b-8ad8-c35f9d92ed4d", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "3. 开放的 `required` 信息项只阻断其影响的阶段；允许将“收集信息”作为下一步或独立探索目标，但不允许把假设写成已经验证。某个 required 信息项只有做完它要挡住的那项工作才有答案，则它不是进入该项工作的门禁。工作开始前已经可以独立查询或核对的事实，仍然可以是进入执行、发布或验收的 required 门禁。", "sequence": 202}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "51ed49d9-3150-47ab-9f85-7f08738a924b", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 203}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "ea742a15-a2f6-43d2-806d-b4b470f0a648", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "4. `deferred` 必须保留级别，并有延期理由、责任人和下一复核日期或触发；到达最晚需要阶段的 `deferred required` 没有 residual 接受时，按开放 required 处理。\r\n", "sequence": 204}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "fe754f2f-f32e-468d-a44d-034d64d53a33", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "5. `accepted-residual` 必须有用户书面决策或审计响应，且明确范围与复审触发；没有该证据时仍视为开放。", "sequence": 205}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "61c333e1-fae0-43e8-ac78-f84a5cc9ca22", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 206}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "20136043-5e57-495c-9834-30dcd077ff61", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
{"type": "tool.shell_output", "data": {"toolCallId": "call_24b236149c6c41fca985750f9b5977cc", "stream": "stdout", "text": "\r\n", "sequence": 207}, "ephemeral": true, "id": "c87e9d01-c8cd-4107-b8aa-f5ad687ca570", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T19:42:45.252Z", "parentId": "b5e62cf9-667b-4924-bd20-5f2b69937e38"}
